  id: 
  abilityName: Critical Drive
  description: '- Effect: Nikita performs a powerful, focused strike. If she has
    accumulated stacks from Critical Momentum, those bonuses improve her chance of
    landing a critical hit and the resulting critical damage.

    - Explanation:
    Nikita converts the critical potential she has built up into a powerful attack.
    This gives players a reason to balance weaker, reliable attacks against a more
    expensive strike with greater damage potential.'
